      "explanation": "A number is divisible by 6 if it is divisible by both 2 and 3. A number is divisible by 2 if its last digit is even, which means it must be either 2 or 4 from the given digits. A number is divisible by 3 if the sum of its digits is divisible by 3.\n<br><br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -29.977ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"39.854ex\" height=\"61.086ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -13750 17615.3 27000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtable\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtr\" transform=\"translate(0,13000)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\"><g data-mml-node=\"mstyle\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(889,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1333.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1833.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2278.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2778.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3167.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3612,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4001,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"><